# Set provider credentials, for example OPENAI_API_KEY, in the deployment environment.
# CONFIG_ENCRYPTION_KEY is a base64-encoded 32-byte key used to encrypt editable provider API keys.
# Generate one with: node -e "console.log(require('node:crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"
